      "side": 1,
      "message": "It will be difficult to add random notations if this is not defined in the spec\n\nWhere is the corresponding API change which populates \"AR\" when invoking ImsPhone.setCallBarring() ? How is this being invoked from app / settings?\n\nAlso this would need changes in the underlying layers.. example QC ImsService which doesn\u0027t have any handling for ACR\n\nDid you also talk to Qualcomm about this?",
